== addendum (1): which position permutations are Clifford (normalize the Pauli group), n = 3 positions
permutations of 8 positions: 40320; affine: 1344; Clifford: 1344; agree everywhere: True
Toffoli (flip bit 2 when bits 0,1 set) affine: False | Clifford: False
single exchange |110> <-> |111> is the Toffoli; at n = 2 every one of the 24 permutations is affine: True

== addendum (1): the shear layer read on the position carrier vs its Weil image
shear preserves the current value at every configuration: True -> position-carrier permutation it induces: identity; Weil image (L=[1]): diag(1, +-i), not identity

== addendum (1): the card-report witness, recomputed
max over products of X/Z card vertices of <XZ>+<ZX>: 1 (affine mixtures cannot exceed the max)
graph state 4*<X(x)Z> = 4 , 4*<Z(x)X> = 4 -> sum = 2

